  "title": {
   "rendered": "Caring for your panels"
  },
  "content": {
   "rendered": "<p>Dust costs a panel up to a fifth of its output in the dry season. Rinse panels with clean water early in the morning, never with soap, and never climb onto the roof yourself.</p>\n<p>We include two cleaning visits a year with every installation.</p>",
   "protected": false
  },
  "excerpt": {
   "rendered": "<p>Keep your panels producing.</p>\n",
